{"id":"portswigger-web-security-academy--server-side-vulnerabilities--server-side-request-forgery-ssrf--basic-ssrf-against-the-local-server","path":"portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/server-side-request-forgery-ssrf/basic-ssrf-against-the-local-server.md","title":"Basic SSRF against the local server","category":"portswigger-web-security-academy","source":"https://github.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/blob/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/portswigger-web-security-academy/server-side-vulnerabilities/server-side-request-forgery-ssrf/basic-ssrf-against-the-local-server.md","html":"<h1 id=\"basic-ssrf-against-the-local-server\">Basic SSRF against the local server</h1>\n<h2 id=\"description\">Description</h2>\n<p>This lab has a stock check feature which fetches data from an internal system.</p>\n<p>To solve the lab, change the stock check URL to access the admin interface at <code>http://localhost/admin</code> and delete the user <code>carlos</code>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"solution\">Solution</h2>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(62)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>Every product has a dedicate check function to retrieve if a product is availble or not:</p>\n<p>value=\"<a href=\"http://stock.weliketoshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1%5C&amp;storeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">http://stock.weliketoshop.net:8080/product/stock/check?productId=1\\&amp;storeId=1</a>\"</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(63)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>clicking to \"Check stock\" button we obtain the number of pieces in stock</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(65)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>We can change the stock check URL to access the admin interface inseriting the stockApi value selecting it and updating it into Inspector field at <code>http://localhost/admin</code></p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(57)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>In this way we're able to access in the admin panel via a SSRF,  and checking into the reponse there're links for deleting users Wiener and Carlos:</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(58)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<p>The scope of the lab is to delete Carlos user, we can do it inserting the deletion link into stockApi value and solving the lab:</p>\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(59)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n\n<figure><button type=\"button\" class=\"image-expand\" aria-label=\"Expand Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Perryong/Writeups-and-Walkthroughs/dd03effbc624dbb8789fbd7775369769cec81a36/.gitbook/assets/image%20(60)%20(1).png\" alt=\"Basic SSRF against the local server screenshot\"></button><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n","toc":[{"id":"description","title":"Description","level":2},{"id":"solution","title":"Solution","level":2}],"excerpt":"Basic SSRF against the local server Description This lab has a stock check feature which fetches data from an internal system. To solve the lab, change the stock check URL to access the admin interface at http://localhos","searchText":"Description Solution"}